9_2056834001928815_3978146616395585472_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ldEBVrlhtiYQ7kNvwGTerBK&_nc_oc=AdqYWYVvgkhIzvPQ1pdc3eWxiDFuUiH9oLJdE_V6MT6dlsr7eNZCLgzh1QVrN7O037g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFbjslBpsmKRQ1PyfEezuUU-OrPx9XmqWYYb6jcgo7Fyg&oe=6A8D6EAF"}, "display_name": "VR Viewer for Insta360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VR Viewer for Insta360 turns your Meta Quest into a personal 360\u00b0 cinema for footage from your Insta360 camera (X5, X4, X3, ONE X / X2, ONE R / RS 360).\n\nThree ways to watch:\n\u2022 Camera over USB \u2014 plug your camera into the Quest and play your shots, transcoded at the best resolution for your headset.\n\u2022 Insta360 Cloud \u2014 open a public Insta360 share link and stream a whole album in VR; browse a thumbnail gallery and pick any clip.\n\u2022 Offline cache \u2014 everything you've opened is saved for instant, offline replay.\n\nFeatures:\n- True immersive 360\u00b0 playback with smooth head-tracking.\n- Multi-file cloud albums with a built-in gallery and a history of opened links.\n- Automatic per-headset resolution \u2014 each device gets exactly the sharpness its display can show.\n- 9 languages, auto-selected from your system language.\n- Comfortable VR interface controlled with the Touch controllers.\n\nNote: this is a 360\u00b0 viewer. Single-lens cameras (GO, Ace, Link) record flat video and are not supported. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Insta360 / Arashi Vision.\n", "short_description": "Watch your Insta360 360\u00b0 videos in VR \u2014 from camera, cloud, or offline."}]}, "developer_name": "Alexey Plekhanov", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://iq4u.kz/insta360_vr_viewer/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://iq4u.kz/insta360_vr_viewer/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Alexey Plekhanov", "support_website_url": "https://iq4u.kz/insta360_vr_viewer/#support", "website_url": "https://iq4u.kz/insta360_vr_viewer/", "category": nu